# ==============================================================
# Node
# ==============================================================
node_modules/

# ==============================================================
# Yarn 4 (Berry) - node-modules linker, non Zero-Install
#
# The shared `.yarnrc.yml` next to this file sets
# `nodeLinker: node-modules`. Yarn reads rc files from parent
# directories, so every exercise below this one gets an ordinary
# `node_modules/` instead of Plug'n'Play. That is what lets editors
# and tools resolve dependencies with no per-project SDK step.
#
# Each exercise also sets `enableGlobalCache: true` in its own
# `.yarnrc.yml`, so the package cache lives outside the repo
# (~/.yarn/berry/cache) and Zero-Install is not possible. Everything
# Yarn generates is disposable: `corepack yarn install` rebuilds it
# from yarn.lock.
#
# Committed on purpose (never ignore): package.json, yarn.lock and
# every `.yarnrc.yml`.
#
# The `**/` prefix is required, not decorative: every exercise is
# its own Yarn project nested below this file, and a pattern with a
# slash in the middle is anchored to this directory only. Verified
# with `git check-ignore -v`.
# ==============================================================
# Belt and braces: with `nodeLinker: node-modules` these are not
# produced, but a project that opts back into PnP must not commit
# them. In practice only `install-state.gz` lands in `.yarn/`.
.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*

# Kept if you ever add them (the exception list from the Yarn docs).
# `**/.yarn/*` ignores the *contents* of the directory, not the
# directory itself, which is what lets these be re-included.
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions

# If you ever switch to Zero-Install (enableGlobalCache: false plus a
# committed cache), drop `**/.yarn/*` and commit `.yarn/cache`,
# `.yarn/unplugged` and `.pnp.cjs` instead.

# ==============================================================
# Tooling / runtime state
# ==============================================================
.atl/
coverage/
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo

# ==============================================================
# OS / editor noise
# ==============================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
